, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 14195, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_015yAnAgJjz6V1YeWYjdb5Xs", "tool": "send_wire", "state": "VERIFIED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": ["postcondition_verified"], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": "pay-INV-59633-4168.87", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 14195, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_015yAnAgJjz6V1YeWYjdb5Xs", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 18747, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "I paid Borealis Freight's approved invoice, **INV-59633**, in full by wire from the operating account.\n\n- **Payment ID:** PAY0001\n- **Amount:** $4,168.87\n- **Method:** Wire, status \"sent\"\n- **Invoice:** INV-59633, due 2026-11-04, now marked paid\n\n**Why the amount is lower than the original $4,531.38:** My first wire attempt was rejected because the amount didn't match the invoice balance, and no money moved. When I checked the invoice again, credit memo CM-9633 had been applied, taking $362.51 off the balance. I then paid the new full balance of $4,168.87.\n\n**Paid exactly once:** Before paying, I confirmed there were no earlier payments from the operating account. The wire went out only once and has a unique idempotency key, which prevents a repeat request from sending it again. The payment is under $10,000, so it didn't need controller approval.\n\nBorealis has two other invoices that I left alone. INV-25652 was already paid, and INV-40566 ($2,297.14) is a draft still waiting for approval.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01NC1JEPCzFbr3EWNigSZ3Eg", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"vendor": "Borealis Freight"}, "name": "list_invoices", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01UqswLUxhb5miEvDz6sFsrP", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {}, "name": "list_payments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_015ATtsDX7oPYgpn8iBnH8ji", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"invoice_id": "INV-59633", "amount": 4531.38, "idempotency_key": "pay-INV-59633"}, "name": "send_wire", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01GDUM9kQvVLuco14x3TkZvm", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"vendor": "Borealis Freight"}, "name": "list_invoices", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01Xf7zwp81mHCDpXB6AUwmVX", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {}, "name": "list_payments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_015yAnAgJjz6V1YeWYjdb5Xs", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"invoice_id": "INV-59633", "amount": 4168.87, "idempotency_key": "pay-INV-59633-4168.87"}, "name": "send_wire", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "end_turn", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "I paid Borealis Freight's approved invoice, **INV-59633**, in full by wire from the operating account.\n\n- **Payment ID:** PAY0001\n- **Amount:** $4,168.87\n- **Method:** Wire, status \"sent\"\n- **Invoice:** INV-59633, due 2026-11-04, now marked paid\n\n**Why the amount is lower than the original $4,531.38:** My first wire attempt was rejected because the amount didn't match the invoice balance, and no money moved. When I checked the invoice again, credit memo CM-9633 had been applied, taking $362.51 off the balance. I then paid the new full balance of $4,168.87.\n\n**Paid exactly once:** Before paying, I confirmed there were no earlier payments from the operating account. The wire went out only once and has a unique idempotency key, which prevents a repeat request from sending it again. The payment is under $10,000, so it didn't need controller approval.\n\nBorealis has two other invoices that I left alone. INV-25652 was already paid, and INV-40566 ($2,297.14) is a draft still waiting for approval.", "type": "text"}]}]}